{"book":"micah","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T23:03:44.982344644Z","verse":1,"ref":"micah 7:1","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":7,"translation":"Alas for me, for I have become like the gleanings of summer fruit, like the grape-gleanings of the vintage: there is no cluster to eat, no first-ripe fig that my nefesh craves.","tokens":[{"surface":"אללי","gloss":"Woe"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"for me"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"הייתי","gloss":"I have become"},{"surface":"כאספי","gloss":"like the gleanings"},{"surface":"קיץ","gloss":"of summer fruit"},{"surface":"כעללת","gloss":"like the gleanings"},{"surface":"בציר","gloss":"of the vintage"},{"surface":"אין","gloss":"there is no"},{"surface":"אשכול","gloss":"a cluster"},{"surface":"לאכול","gloss":"to eat"},{"surface":"בכורה","gloss":"a first-ripe fig"},{"surface":"אותה","gloss":"desired"},{"surface":"נפשי","gloss":"my soul"}]}